--------------------------- OPTIONS -------------------------------------------
9.80665  g                 - Gravitational acceleration (m/s^2); overridden by OpenFAST [default: 9.80665]
1025.0   rhoW              - Water density (kg/m^3); overridden by OpenFAST [default: 1025]
200.0    WtrDpth           - Water depth (m); overridden by OpenFAST flat depth [default: host-owned OpenFAST]
3.0e6    kBot              - Seabed penalty stiffness base (Pa/m) [default: 1.0e5]
3.0e5    cBot              - Seabed normal damping base (Pa-s/m) [default: 1.0e4]
none      frictionMu       - Seabed friction coefficient {none; value>=0} [default: none]
0.4       rhoInf           - Generalised-alpha spectral radius {0<=rhoInf<=1} [default: 0.4]
False     modified_newton  - Tangent-reuse mode {False=full Newton; True=guarded reuse} [default: False]
False     adaptive_mesh    - Automatic finite-EI refinement {False; True} [default: False]
dynamic_solver 1.0e-8 1.0e-14 30 12 - Relative tolerance, absolute tolerance, max iterations, backtracks [defaults shown]
0.025     dtM              - CableDyn internal time step (s); set equal to the example glue DT [default: 0.1 s target]
none      current           - Current model and velocity (m/s) {none; uniform; profile} [default: SeaState host field]
none      waves             - Wave model, height, period, and direction (m, s, deg) {none; airy; jonswap} [default: SeaState host field]
0         WaterKin          - Water-kinematics source {0/none; file; SEASTATE coupled only} [default: no policy/full host field]
